# "Gains flashback until end of turn" (CR 611.2c, 514.2): on turn 1 Flashback lets the Lightning Bolt in the graveyard be cast, but
# Bot1 does not; by turn 3 the grant has ended and the Bolt is not offered from the graveyard, although a Mountain is untapped
# for it. A second Flashback cast on turn 3 gives it back (the positive control), and the Bolt is cast and exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Flashback
Flashback
Mountain
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Hand.Flashback.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flashback.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Exile = Lightning Bolt
